        "TileImage": "$($repository 98d71e20-2c0e-4d67-bfb8-474b41b70666).Image",
        "Description": "For years, Kronstadt Industries has applied robotics and AI into the medical field. In secret, the aim of this advanced tech is at military warfare. CEO Robert Knox has partnered with Dr. Deon Wilson, tech specialist from Quanum Leap, and Dr. Tyler Geier, prior weapon researcher for HX.\rLike a bad sci-fi film come to life, they plan to sell facial recognizing war machines to third-world militias. They are close to a breakthrough; however, without Wilson and Geier the project will come to a halt.",
